z(7,'workedExample','Privileged mode broadens capability/device access and relaxes standard seccomp/LSM restrictions. That can expose host resources and should be treated as highly privileged. It does not itself request host PID/network namespaces or add a VM. The actual host disk name and mountability are system-specific.','Removeuniversal/dev/sda1rootdiskexample.',[dc])
